      <Desc>AS A CHANNEL OF GODS LOVE TO THE HURTING, WE ACTIVELY CARE FOR WIDOWS AND ORPHANS, BEGGERS ON STREET CORNERS, AND HOMELESS FOLKS SLEEPING UNDER BRIDGES. THIS LOVE TAKES ACTION BY PURCHASING BEANS,RICE AND OTHER FOODSTUFFS IN 100LB SACKS FOR THE POOR WHO REGULARLY KNOCK ON OUR DOOR. DISTRIBUTING BLANKETS, TARPS, TO THOSE WHO ARE HOMELESS. LARGER PROJECTS INCLUDE BUILDING HOMES AND SHELTER.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>177306</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>AS LATINS HAVE EMBRACED GOD'S CALL TO GO OUT TO THE NATIONS WITH THE GOSPEL WE WORK CLOSELY WITH LOCAL CHURCHES AND LEADERS TO TRAIN THEM IN HOW TO SUPPORT AND PASTOR THEIR MISSIONARIES ON THE FIELD. WE ALSO PARTICIPATE IN FINANCIALLY SUPPORTING LATIN MISSIONS' WORKRES WHO HAVE FAR LESS SUPPORT CHANNELS THAN MISSIONARIES ABLE TO PARTNER WITH US BASED MISSIONS ORGANIZATIONS.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
